\v 3 We will¦154224 have grace¦154228, mercy¦154229, and peace¦154230 in truth¦154246 and love¦154248 from \nd God¦154233\nd* the father¦154234 and from his son¦154241 \nd Yeshua¦154238\nd* the \nd messiah¦154239\nd*.
\s1 Stick to the original message
