\v 4 I was¦154249 so happy that I found¦154252 some¦154252 of¦154254 your¦154257 children¦154256 living out the truth¦154260 as¦154261 per the command¦154262 that the father¦154268 gave us.
\v 5 So¦154269 now¦154270 I'm¦154271 requesting you¦154272, lady, (not¦154274 making some new¦154277 command¦154276, but¦154269 one that we've had¦154285 since the¦154287 beginning¦154287) that we all need to love¦154289 each other\x + \xo 5: \xt Yhn 13:34; 15:12,17.\x*
\v 6 where the definition of love is obeying God's commands¦154300. This is the command¦154308 about walking in love that¦154292 you¦154314 all¦154314 heard¦154314 from the beginning¦154316
\v 7 because many¦154323 false preachers have entered the world¦154329 who don't¦154331 believe that \nd Yeshua¦154333\nd* is the messiah who came¦154325 as a human. Any person like that is a deceiver¦154341 and¦154342 against the messiah.
\p
\v 8 So make sure that¦154348 you¦154350 all¦154350 don't¦154349 lose¦154350 what¦154353 you've worked for, but¦154356 rather go on to receive a full¦154358 reward¦154357.
\p
\v 9 Anyone¦154375 who doesn't stay with the \nd messiah's¦154375\nd* teaching or adds more to it doesn't have \nd God¦154376\nd*—it's the person who continues in¦154381 the his teaching that¦154362 has both¦154387 the father¦154390 and¦154391 the son¦154394 with them.
\v 10 If anyone¦154397 comes¦154398 to¦154399 you¦154400 all¦154400 and doesn't bring¦154408 this¦154402 same message, don't accept that person into¦154412 your house¦154413, and don't tell¦154418 them that it's good
\v 11 because¦154421 anyone who encourages those people is¦154425 participating in¦154426 the evil¦154430 that they're spreading.
\s1 Closing off
