\p
\v 12 I've got many¦154431 things that I wanted to write¦154435 to you about, but¦154441 paper¦154440 and ink¦154442 aren't¦154437 working for me so I'll try to come and then we can talk directly because I want you¦154434 all¦154434 to experience genuine happiness.
